  "draft_py": "# Agonizing Syphon (M20) sorcery: Agonizing Syphon deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.\n# The compiler gave no tree at all, so the SpellAbility(SORCERY) is added here (guide: refused outright).\n# \"any target\": the B5b-damage-any selector (Shock). \"you gain 3 life\": B4-gain-life-n.\nany_target = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FOr(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Planeswalker'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Player'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nspell = SpellAbility(\n    kind=SpellKind.SORCERY,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {'amount': QConst(value=3), 'target': any_target}),\n            A(Verb.GAIN_LIFE, {'amount': QConst(value=3), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [spell]\n",
